                <p><em>ISSUES</em> is published in Christian Education (ISSN 0828-0216) in published three times a year by the faculty of Concordia University, Seward, Nebraska. Copies are available for purchase at the university bookstore and through the online store. Subscriptions are available for individuals and institutions. Please contact the circulation office for more information.</p>
