      <p>4:35). We rejoice that the Hispanic Institute</p>
      <p>of Theology, Concordia Seminary, St. Louis,</p>
      <p>prepares Spanish-speaking women as commis-</p>
      <p>ioners of mercy. Christ is also served</p>
      <p>through the many Anglo deaconesses who have</p>
