      <p>Hispanic Institute of Theology pre-</p>
      <p>pares pastors and son, deaconesses, for ser-</p>
      <p>vice principally within their cultural contexts</p>
      <p>in the U.S.</p>
      <p>During the last 15 years, deaconesses</p>
